{"id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:induced-orientation","title":"def:induced-orientation","path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.md","line":1633,"body":"","kind":"definition","status":"not_started","tex":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex#def:induced-orientation","uses":["[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:unit-normal]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:interior-multiplication]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:nonvanishing-top-form-orientation]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:adapted-frame-ambient-basis]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:volume-form-pointwise]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex","label":"def:induced-orientation","line":2738,"source":"\\begin{definition}[The Orientation Induced by a Unit Normal]\n\\label{def:induced-orientation}\n\n\\uses{def:unit-normal, def:interior-multiplication, lem:nonvanishing-top-form-orientation, lem:adapted-frame-ambient-basis, def:volume-form-pointwise}\n\n\n\nFor a unit normal field $N$ along an isometric hypersurface immersion, the \\emph{induced orientation} at $x$ is the orientation determined by the nonzero form $((N\\lrcorner dV_{\\widetilde g})|_M)_x$.\n\\end{definition}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Definition</div></section>[The Orientation Induced by a Unit Normal] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-6465663a696e64756365642d6f7269656e746174696f6e\"></span> <p></p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Aunit-normal\">↗ def:unit-normal</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Ainterior-multiplication\">↗ def:interior-multiplication</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Anonvanishing-top-form-orientation\">↗ lem:nonvanishing-top-form-orientation</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Aadapted-frame-ambient-basis\">↗ lem:adapted-frame-ambient-basis</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Avolume-form-pointwise\">↗ def:volume-form-pointwise</a> <p></p>For a unit normal field <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$N$\">$N$</span> along an isometric hypersurface immersion, the <em>induced orientation</em> at <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$x$\">$x$</span> is the orientation determined by the nonzero form <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$((N\\lrcorner dV_{\\widetilde g})|_M)_x$\">$((N\\lrcorner dV_{\\widetilde g})|_M)_x$</span>. ","warnings":[]},"previous":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:nonvanishing-top-form-orientation","next":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:induced-orientation-characterization","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:unit-normal","title":"def:unit-normal","label":"def:unit-normal"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:interior-multiplication","title":"def:interior-multiplication","label":"def:interior-multiplication"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:nonvanishing-top-form-orientation","title":"lem:nonvanishing-top-form-orientation","label":"lem:nonvanishing-top-form-orientation"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:adapted-frame-ambient-basis